  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CIPCA policy unit (Unidad de Acci&#xf3;n Pol&#xed;tica )</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will continue CIPCA&#x2019;s advocacy work to lobby the Bolivian Government to implement rural development policies that benefit indigenous campesinos. This will involve building the capacity of male and female leaders of indigenous campesinos organisations to prepare and deliver proposals on rural development to the government. CIPCA will then monitor whether the government implements the proposals from indigenous campesinos organisations. It will also entail providing the government with accurate analysis and recommendations on rural development policies to guide public policy at a time when they are open to dialogue with civil society.</narrative>
  </description>
